{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112662","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112662/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112662/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112662/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112662","id":3615645476,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7Xgl8k","number":112662,"title":"Core: Variant `initializer_list` constructor can unexpectedly create arrays","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-11-12T09:10:32Z","updated_at":"2025-11-12T23:10:12Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.5, 4.6 dev\n\n### System information\n\nN/A\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe `initializer_list` constructor of `Variant` can unexpectedly be triggered by innocuous code:\n\n```c++\n// In 4.5 the Variant type is Array, in 4.4 it was String.\nVariant array = {String(\"\")};\n```\n\nThis has caused unexpected changes of semantics, for example in @friendnard's module, where it introduced bugs they had to track down.\n\nRegression from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/86015, cc @kitbdev \n\nI recommend removing the `initializer_list` constructor from `Variant` again. It is not clear that `Variant` multi-argument construction should result in an array anyway. It's better to construct the array explicitly.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nN/A\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112662/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112662/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}